Real-Time Example: Bus Ticket Booking

| Agent          | Type                     | Responsibility                                                   |
| -------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |
| User           | Human                    | Requests a bus ticket                                            |
| UserProxyAgent | Conversable Agent        | Receives the user's request and coordinates the workflow         |
| AssistantAgent | AI Agent                 | Understands the travel request and decides what needs to be done |
| Search Agent   | Conversable/Custom Agent | Searches available buses                                         |
| Seat Agent     | Conversable/Custom Agent | Checks seat availability                                         |
| Payment Agent  | Conversable/Custom Agent | Handles payment                                                  |
| Booking Agent  | Conversable/Custom Agent | Confirms the booking                                             |


